      "message": "test(post): per-post script suites on recorded edge-case streams\n\nEvery shipped post script (assets/posts/*.cps) gets a suite in\ncrates/post/tests (script_<stem>.rs) that runs the post binary on nine\nrecorded .cnc streams - arcs in each plane and a helix, a full circle\n(as generated, and as one hand-written 360-degree record), a peck cycle\nwith a retract change, a tool change with a spindle direction change, a\nrotary index and a tilted move (on tilthead.mch), a probing cycle, an\nempty section, very small and very large coordinates - and compares the\nprogram or the named refusal with a golden beside the suites. No app,\nno toolpath generation in the suites.\n\nStaleness guards: recorded_streams (post) rebuilds the six cl-built\nstreams through post::dump; app's recorded_post_streams rebuilds the\nprobe and drill streams from motion; the hand-written stream parses and\nround-trips. Post bugs the goldens showed are filed (#994-#998) and the\nwrong outputs are listed as known bugs, not baked into goldens.\n\nSlice 1; moving the ten app tests is left for slice 2.\n\nRefs #926\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
